店，推薦給喜歡濃郁系湯頭又愛喝湯的朋友！",null,[0,30]]]],[null,1762396957000000,1762396957000000,"9 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfdVJpeGp6UTdsVVlUcFB4azY4RUExdw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfdVJpeGp6UTdsVVlUcFB4azY4RUExdxoTQ2d3SW5aYXd5QVlRcTgzcWpRSQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiUutrhv9KWAxVBna8BHVbaLVYQ_2MIuwEoGQ"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/1754047210059248725/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnc1UWxKcmJFSmFWa28wWW10YVdscHRjRlZVVkd0NFpVVlJNMVF3UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1754047210059248725/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnc1UWxKcmJFSmFWa28wWW10YVdscHRjRlZVVkd0NFpVVlJNMVF3UlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/1754047210059248725/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnc1UWxKcmJFSmFWa28wWW10YVdscHRjRlZVVkd0NFpVVlJNMVF3UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1754047210059248725/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnc1UWxKcmJFSmFWa28wWW10YVdscHRjRlZVVkd0NFpVVlJNMVF3UlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1754047210059248725/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnc1UWxKcmJFSmFWa28wWW10YVdscHRjRlZVVkd0NFpVVlJNMVF3UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1754047210059248725/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnc1UWxKcmJFSmFWa28wWW10YVdscHRjRlZVVkd0NFpVVlJNMVF3UlJBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["謝謝您給予初原的好評支持\n有您的鼓勵會讓我們更有動力\n\n也歡迎追蹤點讚我們初原的FB和IG唷",null,[0,26]]]],[null,null,8243,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5QlJrbEJaVko0YmtaWlptcFVUVGt4ZUVRM1QwRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x4382d31ca9fe1bd0!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOl9BRklBZVJ4bkZZZmpUTTkxeEQ3T0E%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5QlJrbEJaVko0YmtaWlptcFVUV